   "widgets_values": [
    "A hand-drawn anime illustration of a girl sitting alone at a small round table on a seaside cafe terrace on a hot late-summer afternoon, seen from across the table through an open window. She has long black hair moving in the sea breeze and wears a simple white cotton sundress with thin straps. Her right elbow is on the table and her head leans into her right hand, cheek pushed up against her palm, face turned slightly away; with her left hand she idly plays with a plain straight paper straw in a tall glass of pale, matte lemon soda with crushed ice, a lemon wheel and mint, standing on the table in the soft shade. Her expression is bored and a little dreamy, eyes half-lidded. She sits entirely in the cool soft shade of the awning; only the sea and sky behind her are in bright sun. Behind her a white railing opens onto a turquoise sea, towering cumulonimbus clouds and a thin contrail in a deep blue sky. The scalloped cream fringe of an awning hangs across the very top, the dark edge of a window frame cuts down the right side and the back of an empty wicker chair is blurred in the near foreground. The overall mood is lazy, nostalgic and slightly melancholic, with a bright palette of cyan, white, lemon yellow and warm skin tones, clean slightly sketchy lineart, soft cel shading and strong summer light."
